{
  "slug": "coinpaprika",
  "name": "Coinpaprika",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Access cryptocurrency market data from CoinPaprika: real-time prices, OHLCV, exchanges, contract lookups for 12,000+ cryptocurrencies and 350+ exchanges. Free tier, no API key needed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `crypto-market-search` (Search and analyze cryptocurrency market data using CoinPaprika)\n- **Agents** (1): `crypto-analyst` (Cryptocurrency market analyst - price trends, fundamentals, risk assessment using CoinPaprika data for 12,000+ cryptocurrencies and 350+ exchanges)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `coinpaprika`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install coinpaprika@claude-community` from `coinpaprika/claude-marketplace` (`plugins/coinpaprika-claude-plugin`).",
